# Pairs with CompletedReclaimCleared. Clearing the marker before the victim leaves a lost obligation.
MODULE: CompleteBeforeClear
TARGET: CompletedReclaimCleared
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reclaim marker is retired while the victim still exists
PERTURBS: Complete

--- FIND
    /\ ~victimExists
    /\ pending' = "none"
--- REPLACE
    /\ pending' = "none"
--- END
